# cargo-mutants output — a build artifact, not a record. Every run rewrites the
# whole directory, so tracking it made each mutation run a ~9,500-line diff
# across 130 files and buried the actual change in the commit. The report is
# still kept on CI, which uploads this directory as a workflow artifact
# (.github/workflows/ci.yml). `mutants.out.old` is the previous run, which
# cargo-mutants rotates automatically.
mutants.out/
mutants.out.old/
